* 19 Nov 26 dm  THE PERSON LOADS THEIR OWN (owner, 19 Nov 2026: "wouldnt it be easier to just have the user load the examples rather than do it for
*               every account.  most accounts will not need the examples"; of bp.edit, "respect the gate").  With no account named the examples go
*               into the account the session is in, for anybody who has bp.edit (11408 otherwise, before anything is written); naming accounts is
